        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on preclinical data, we believe that our lead oral small molecule amylin development candidate, ACCG-2671, has the potential to be the first-in-class oral small molecule amylin treatment option for obesity, and we have declared a second amylin development candidate, ACCG-3535.",
