        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Beyond our GLP-1R and amylin receptor programs, we are developing next generation oral incretins for potential combination therapy with GLP-1R or amylin candidates.",
